          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(47, 184, 198, 1)" fontSize="17.0" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">闭环解决了什么</span></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="364" height="67" topLeftX="67.67999999999998" topLeftY="295.2" type="text" id="bll">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="9.5" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <ul listStyle="pptx-bullet">
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><strong><span color="rgba(234, 242, 248, 1)" fontSize="9.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">把「相关」变成「因果」：如果调控改变了信号、信号变化又伴随状态变化，说明该信号确实与状态相关。</span></strong></p></li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(234, 242, 248, 1)" fontSize="9.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">让 BCI 从被动测量变成 assessment + intervention system。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(234, 242, 248, 1)" fontSize="9.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">把「读完就结束」的评估，变成可以反复修正的过程。</span></p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </content>
