          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(217, 138, 33, 1)" fontSize="17.0" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">闭环同时制造了什么（本汇报推论）</span></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="377.748031496063" height="122.4" topLeftX="514.548031496063" topLeftY="295.2" type="text" id="blM">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <ul listStyle="pptx-bullet">
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:17.00" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(234, 242, 248, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">ground truth 不再独立：调控本身改变了状态，「再检测」读到的可能不是自然状态。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:17.00" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(234, 242, 248, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">因此闭环研究必须预设「自然状态基线 + 调控后对照」，否则因果解释会绕回自己。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:17.00" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(234, 242, 248, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">伦理问题的性质也变了：从 mental privacy（读不读得到）变成 agency（能不能被调控、谁来授权）。</span></p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </content>
      </shape>
